<title>FINLAND: FINNISH TRAIN FARES TO RISE 1.8 PCT IN 1997 -VR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH TRAIN FARES TO RISE 1.8 PCT IN 1997 -VR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger fares on Finnish trains will be raised by on average 1.8 percent in 1997, Finnish State Railways (VR) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Operating costs will rise clearly more, VR said.</p>
<p>The weight of train fares in the consumer price index is 0.38 percent, an official at Statistics Finland said by telephone.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
